{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flock Around\u00a0</strong>is a co-op birdwatching game where you explore a nature sanctuary. Solo or with friends, snap pictures of funny birds, and fill out the park guide book!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618030/extras/c6439692fdd002934a85f18b9ef2757d.poster.avif?t=1761690042\" width=728 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618030/extras/c6439692fdd002934a85f18b9ef2757d.webm?t=1761690042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618030/extras/c6439692fdd002934a85f18b9ef2757d.mp4?t=1761690042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snap them all!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goose Lake Sanctuary is home to numerous bird species, and if you can see it, you can take a picture of it. Fill out the guide book with pictures of each bird in its various poses, from the common Robin, to the rare Golden Goose. Explore a variety of biomes, perform actions and emotes to lure in exotic species, and mess with your friends! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618030/extras/ef0414cc995954c86d2972cf6e65dd61.poster.avif?t=1761690042\" width=728 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618030/extras/ef0414cc995954c86d2972cf6e65dd61.webm?t=1761690042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618030/extras/ef0414cc995954c86d2972cf6e65dd61.mp4?t=1761690042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flock Together!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flock Around\u00a0is designed to be a shared social space where you and your friends can work together to get pictures of birds, turtles, or even each other.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618030/extras/77a42e1b2163ccbfc4dcec165cb336f1.poster.avif?t=1761690042\" width=728 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618030/extras/77a42e1b2163ccbfc4dcec165cb336f1.webm?t=1761690042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618030/extras/77a42e1b2163ccbfc4dcec165cb336f1.mp4?t=1761690042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your birder!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Collect cosmetics and make your birder unique, expressing your personality and eagle eyes to your friends.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618030/extras/6eee9ef10ae2462201b356605604c33f.poster.avif?t=1761690042\" width=728 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618030/extras/6eee9ef10ae2462201b356605604c33f.webm?t=1761690042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618030/extras/6eee9ef10ae2462201b356605604c33f.mp4?t=1761690042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618030?t=1761690042","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618030?t=1761690042","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst